  "format": 1,
  "title": {
    "en": "Quick Phrases",
    "zh": "快捷短语"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Reusable prompt shortcuts beside the composer: one click fills or sends \"continue\", \"commit\", \"push\", \"release\" and anything else you type often. Each phrase keeps a short display name and its own text, and the manager lets you reorder, edit and pick where the row appears.",
    "zh": "输入框旁的一排快捷短语：点一下就填入或直接发送「继续」「提交」「推送」「发版」等常用文本。每条短语的显示名称与发送内容分开，管理页可增删改、拖动手柄排序，还能选择短语行的显示位置。"
  },
